    <craft:has_subsumed_GO_BP_class>http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/GO_0048519</craft:has_subsumed_GO_BP_class>
    <craft:annotatable_text>down regulate; down regulates; down regulated; down regulating; down regulation; down regulations; down regulatory; downregulate; downregulates; downregulated; downregulating;  downregulation; downregulations; downregulatory; down-regulate; down-regulates; down-regulated; down-regulating; down-regulation; down-regulations; down-regulatory; negatively regulate; negatively regulates; negatively regulated; negatively regulating; negative regulation; negative regulations; negatively regulatory</craft:annotatable_text>
