    <craft:annotatable_text>differentiate; differentiated; differentiates; differentiating; differentiation; differentiative</craft:annotatable_text>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>An occurrence of a developmental process in which a relatively unspecialized anatomical entity (e.g., cell, tissue, organ) acquires specialized structural and/or functional features; or, an attribute of such an occurrence, eg., of being, becoming, or having become specialized in such an occurrence.</obo:IAO_0000115>
  </owl:Class>
  <owl:Class rdf:about="http://craftcorpus.org/CRAFT_DNA_recombinant_entity">
