    <craft:annotatable_text>skeletal formation; skeletogenesis; skeletogenic</craft:annotatable_text>
    <obo:IAO_0000115>An occurrence of skeletal system morphogenesis or development; or, an attribute of such an occurrence, e.g., of involving or being involved in such an occurrence.</obo:IAO_0000115>
